------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NOT A MEDICAL DEVICE
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

AUDIRE is a research system. It is not a medical device, it is not validated for
clinical use, and its outputs must not be used to diagnose, treat, or make
clinical decisions about hearing loss. All results currently recorded in
docs/RESULTS.md were produced on SYNTHETIC listener cohorts and are not clinical
evidence.
